OpenColorIO-rs

A Rust port of OpenColorIO (https://github.com/AcademySoftwareFoundation/OpenColorIO).
Each release states the OpenColorIO version it matches; this line matches
OpenColorIO 2.6.0 (upstream tag v2.6.0, commit 10a43ec1df03d072ca9a9e2fb3f26e454b0900d8).

The port is a derivative work of OpenColorIO and is distributed under the same
BSD-3-Clause license (see LICENSE):

    Copyright Contributors to the OpenColorIO Project.

Test data under fixtures/ is generated by the official OpenColorIO 2.6.0 Python
wheel (PyPI: opencolorio==2.6.0). Test data and tests ported from upstream's
tests/ directory keep upstream's BSD-3-Clause license and notice.

Third-party code
----------------

The port also translates code from other projects: from libraries OpenColorIO 2.6.0 is built
with, and from the files OpenColorIO carries under their own notices. THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES.md
lists each one, what the port takes from it and where, with its copyright and license notice.
